---
manual: app.top_level_is_flow
lines: [855, 857]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @a = button "A", width: 100
  @b = button "B", width: 100
  @c = button "C", width: 100
end
----------- test code
a, b, c = %w[@a @b @c].map { |name| layout_of(button(name)) }

assert_in_delta a.y, b.y, 0.5, "elements placed at the top level share a row"
assert_in_delta a.y, c.y, 0.5
assert_in_delta a.x + a.w, b.x, 0.5, "each follows the last, left to right"
assert_in_delta b.x + b.w, c.x, 0.5
